---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "WITH r AS (SELECT a, rand() AS x FROM t) SELECT p.a FROM r p JOIN r q ON p.a = q.a WHERE p.x > 0.5"
---
WithCte [r]
:- Project [a#0, rand() AS x#3]
:  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
+- Project [a#4]
   +- Join Inner, (a#4 == a#6)
      :- Project [a#6]
      :  +- Shift +2
      :     +- CteRef r [a#4, x#5] (shared #1)
      +- Project [a#4]
         +- Filter (x#5 > 0.5D)
            +- Shared #1, printed above
